<!--
Keep this file narrow and reviewable.

Every suppression must be tied to a specific finding and include:
- why: short rationale for accepting the finding
- owner: team or reviewer accountable for revalidation
- reviewed: YYYY-MM-DD
- revalidate-by: YYYY-MM-DD or release tag for the next required check
- reference: issue, PR, or review discussion that approved the exception

Prefer matching on bug code and class or method instead of broad package-level exclusions.
Delete suppressions when the underlying code or the detector output changes.
-->
<FindBugsFilter>
    <!--
    why: The container error dispatch replays the failing request's original HTTP method to /error,
         so the mapping must accept every method, matching Spring Boot's own BasicErrorController.
         The handler only renders a localized ProblemDetail for an already-failed request and
         performs no state change, so CSRF protection does not apply to it.
    owner: technical-interview-demo maintainers
    reviewed: 2026-06-12
    revalidate-by: v2.2.0
    reference: .agents/plans/PLAN_session_attribute_write_race.md Task 2
    -->
    <Match>
        <Class name="team.jit.technicalinterviewdemo.technical.api.ApiErrorController"/>
        <Bug pattern="SPRING_CSRF_UNRESTRICTED_REQUEST_MAPPING"/>
    </Match>
</FindBugsFilter>
